    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>You must have a paid Klaviyo account to use this feature.</p>\n</div>\n<p>Learn how to build segments with AI built directly into Klaviyo’s segment builder. This tool accepts natural language inputs (i.e., normal phrases and sentences) and converts them into a Klaviyo segment.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JF0RJBE8MYDBZ74QF19FFBVX\">How to define segments with AI</h2>\n<p>This assistant creates segments using generative AI technology, however you are still responsible for the final segment definition.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Audiences</strong> &gt; <strong>Lists &amp; segments</strong>. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create New &gt; Create segment</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add a name for your segment. </li>\n<li>Type out a sentence or phrase describing your desired segment directly in the condition selector. Not sure what to try? Start with the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T_9S0j0Ljqe5SFDiSx_F8eoybtCWrlvIgKb4sBK43EI/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.jq1bykobo0nv\">examples below</a>. <br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31964144945435\" alt=\"Segments AI.jpg\">\n</li>\n<li>After entering your desired prompt, either:<br>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Click the text shown under <em>Define with AI</em>.<br>\nor</li>\n<li>Hit <em>Enter</em> on your keyboard.</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>You can edit individual conditions manually, or by selecting the <em>Define with AI</em> option when expanding a condition.</li>\n<li>To start again with a new prompt, delete the generated conditions.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31964136561307\" alt=\"Segments AI 2.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JF0RJBE9QB9RQK0G9TTC1M1G\">Example prompts</h2>\n<p>Not sure where to start? Try these sample inputs to see how the tool works:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Engaged profiles last 30 days</li>\n<li>Unengaged profiles last 365 days</li>\n<li>Someone who has viewed a product and not made a purchase in the last 60 days</li>\n<li>Someone who has started checkout or viewed a product but never placed an order</li>\n<li>Everyone who lives within 100 miles of Boston, MA</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
